cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or audit toolkit, please cite the paper and this archive."
title: "unagi-kc-audit: dual-spectrum audit code for GRN-prior injection in single-cell VAEs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yan"
    given-names: "Yinan"
  - family-names: "Wang"
    given-names: "Lan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yimyinan/unagi-kc-audit"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Analysis and audit code supporting "Gene-regulatory priors do not reach the loss: a
  dual-spectrum audit of single-cell variational autoencoders". Contains the released
  kappa_c_audit toolkit (four checks: gradient, prior-strength scan, structural bound and
  injection-path), the figure generators, the derived result files, and the audit records
  documenting the provenance of every reported number.
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - variational autoencoder
  - gene regulatory network
  - prior injection
  - reproducibility
